  "description": "While everyone piles into fear assets, I'm positioning for the next market rotation.",
  "body_html": "<p>Look where others are not. </p><ul><li><p>In 2022, I bought Russian Rubles. This was right after U.S. Sanctions sent them plummeting. At the time, I received so much online hate. “You’re anti-American!” “You’re a Russian sympathizer!” The hate was so bad, I eventually had to take the YouTube videos down. </p><ul><li><p>About 3 months later, I took a trip to Mexico and exchanged those Rubles for a 92% gain. </p></li></ul></li><li><p>In 2023, everyone was screaming “Go woke go broke!” hammering against Disney. </p><ul><li><p>I made about 26% of that 45% run upwards. </p></li></ul></li><li><p>Just last year in 2025, Roblox was getting TON of hate due to it being a dangerous platform for children, where online predators prey on them. (I fully support the hate Roblox received, and do not let my own kids on the internet). </p><ul><li><p>Roblox was our biggest win at 61%</p></li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>The point being:</strong> Look where others are not looking…or even there is tons of public outlash. I am not saying that the public disgrace is not warranted. What I am saying, is oftentimes, these assets run the most. And <strong>YOU MUST CHECK YOUR FEELINGS AT THE DOOR. </strong></p><p>Everyone right now…having seen hundreds of comments the last few days…is debating whether gold, silver, bitcoin is undergoing just a dip or a plummeting continuation. The narrative being “government instability.” Maybe they go up. Maybe they continue down. Who knows. Frankly, I do not care. These circle jerk conversations tell me the focus is in the wrong place. The herd usually runs off the cliff together…screaming “buy the dip!”</p><p>What no one is talking about right now, is legacy finance stocks. Yes, I know many of you (especially you secret crypto people) hate banks. You hate traditional finance. And that is ok, that is your prerogative. I am not here to sway you politically, left or right, what is right or wrong. But these bank stocks continue to push upwards, quietly leaving retail investors behind. My speculation is retail will come flocking in a few months and act as exit liquidity for us. Sadly. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png\" width=\"896\" height=\"646\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:646,&quot;width&quot;:896,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:60143,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/186743789?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!75rB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa30ba074-6e53-4cbf-8ff4-74c066f639f0_896x646.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok ETF continues to show extreme resilience, and growth. Leaving retail investors quietly behind. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Do not feel like you are “late”. The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF Build Video</a> was built for 2026 to be a lazy portfolio. I expect many of the stocks to perform for several months. </p><h4>If you are interested in our latest purchase yesterday, check out my post: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/another-breakout-another-stocktok?r=4z8lgl\">Another Breakout, Another Buy</a></h4><p>You don’t have to tell your friends or family that you are buying the most hated stocks. You can keep it a secret. 🤫</p><p>If you have a stock you would like me to review, I will be doing Mid-Week Movers tomorrow. Leave your favorite ticker <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-209247291?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">On THIS NOTE.</a> One per person please.</p><p><strong>If you like this post, please like ❤️, re-stack and consider sharing with someone else. It makes a big difference fighting through the AI-slop and takes only 2 seconds.</strong> </p><p>As always, questions are welcome in the main chat. Thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
